  "name": "FurryPinas",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "FurryPinas was a Philippine furry convention in Metro Manila, organized by the Philippine Furry Con Leaders Roundtable and supporting Hands of GOD Charity Works. It succeeded PHAnthroFest, with a vision of an annual hub for furry content open to anyone interested, from fursuiting and art to cosplay, music, games and anime. The first FurryPinas was held May 19 to 20, 2018, at the SMX Convention Center, and the second June 8 to 9, 2019, at the Bayanihan Center. With over 1,700 attendees in 2019 it was Asia's largest furry convention until JMOF 2024.",
